**`rust/src/lib.rs`** — added `filter_by_tag`:
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes
        .iter()
        .filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag))
        .collect()
}
```
Exact match via `==` (not substring), order preserved by iterating `notes` in order.

**`rust/src/main.rs`** — the `list` command now parses an optional `--tag <TAG>` flag and routes through `filter_by_tag` when present; otherwise lists all notes.

